From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:23:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): trim heatmap settings page and blend the heatmap
 card

- Drop the aggregated overview and the last-7-days list from the statistics
  page: every number already lives on the home heatmap card, so the page is
  now just the palette/custom color rows and the data & privacy section.
- Fold the privacy note into the tracking switch summary and remove the
  duplicated hex from the palette summary.
- Give the heatmap card the page surface (colorSurfaceContainerLow + a
  hairline outlineVariant stroke) and lift the metric chips one step higher,
  so the card matches the home background while keeping its rounded box.
- Use an explicit dark stage behind the keyboard theme preview (theme page
  tab strip and custom theme editor), so dark keyboard themes are judged
  against a dark backdrop instead of the pastel dynamic-color surface.
